      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "module/socket  (presentation)\n\nHandler.HandleConnect — auth in-handler → real 401,\n   then websocket.Accept (OriginPatterns)\nService — subscribe / unsubscribe dispatch, ack/error\nAuthorizer — topic policy (own topics only)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "mod",
      "originalText": "module/socket  (presentation)\n\nHandler.HandleConnect — auth in-handler → real 401,\n   then websocket.Accept (OriginPatterns)\nService — subscribe / unsubscribe dispatch, ack/error\nAuthorizer — topic policy (own topics only)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
