      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "infrastructure/socket  (stateful runtime)\n\nHub — registry: user→conns, topic→conns; marshal-once fan-out;\n   per-user cap; CloseAll(StatusGoingAway)\nConn — 1 readPump + 1 writePump(owns graceful close) + ping;\n   bounded send buffer → slow consumer dropped",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "infra",
      "originalText": "infrastructure/socket  (stateful runtime)\n\nHub — registry: user→conns, topic→conns; marshal-once fan-out;\n   per-user cap; CloseAll(StatusGoingAway)\nConn — 1 readPump + 1 writePump(owns graceful close) + ping;\n   bounded send buffer → slow consumer dropped",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
